e-8d48-cb8041ac67fb.jpg","image_width":160,"link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/women","title":""}},"logo_8PkdFX":{"type":"logo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/25_c6700bf1-04dc-4434-9672-4360486c1d91.jpg","image_width":160,"link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/kids","title":""}},"logo_9FRt9j":{"type":"logo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/24_77200486-fa39-42bb-9c4f-99ad88cdc979.jpg","image_width":160,"link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/house","title":""}}},"block_order":["logo_BhFUt9","logo_8PkdFX","logo_9FRt9j"],"custom_css":[".logo-list__logo {max-width: 25%; margin-left: 3%; margin-right: 3%;}","@media (min-width: 786px) {.logo-list__logo-image {width: 130px; }}"],"settings":{"title":"Explore Other Sections","image_opacity":100,"color_scheme":"default"}},"rich_text_mDdTPW":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_bacNd3":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Shein Men's Fashion in Oman","use_h1":true}},"text_PXrbeT":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>No waiting weeks for a package that may never arrive. Our Muscat warehouse is stocked with the latest Shein menswear, delivered to your door in less than 48 hours.<\/p><p>Cash on delivery  ·  Easy returns  ·  Outlet prices<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_bacNd3","text_PXrbeT"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"height":"medium","text_alignment":"center","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"default"}},"collapsible_tabs_xWFRTT":{"type":"collapsible-tabs","blocks":{"question_44LVpf":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Why Beisat is Oman's Best Destination for Shein Men's Fashion","answer":"<ul><li><strong>Already in Oman:<\/strong> Every item ships from our Muscat warehouse, no customs, no cross-border delays.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li><strong>48-Hour Delivery:<\/strong> Order today, receive tomorrow or the day after, anywhere in Oman.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li><strong>Cash on Delivery:<\/strong> Pay when it arrives, no cards needed.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li><strong>Real Outlet Prices: <\/strong>Shein quality at prices that make sense for Oman.<\/li><\/ul>"}},"question_dHA7bE":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"A Smarter Way to Upgrade Your Wardrobe","answer":"<p>Shein menswear has come a long way. The fits are better, the range is wider, and the prices still make sense. <\/p><p>The only problem was always the shipping. <a href=\"https:\/\/beisat.com\/?srsltid=AfmBOopWLY5C69KtikUmUl9Pp-4BGaYWLhgfUUigOUUfj8LmGkJrJp1I\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Beisat<\/span><\/a> solves that. We are a dedicated Shein men's outlet based in Muscat. <\/p><p>We buy inventory in bulk, store it locally, and deliver it fast. Whether you want a clean casual shirt for the weekend, gym joggers, a smart-casual look for the office, or a full street-style fit — we have it in stock right now. <\/p><p>You get the same Shein products, the same quality, and the same prices, just without the three-week wait and the customs question mark.<\/p>"}},"question_kQJ3cY":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Shein Men's Collection at Beisat Oman","answer":"<p>Beisat stocks the full Shein men's range: casual shirts, shorts, joggers, hoodies, gym wear, smart-casual trousers, outerwear, and accessories, all held in our Muscat warehouse and ready to ship. <\/p><p>Because we run as an outlet, many pieces are stocked in limited quantities. That makes every purchase feel a little more exclusive. You are not just buying what everyone else already has. <\/p><p>The browsing experience is built for speed: filter by category or style, save favourites, and check out in a few taps.<\/p><p>Cash on delivery, regular discounts, and a mobile-first app make the whole process straightforward. <\/p><p>If Shein has it for men, we probably have it in stock right now, and it can be at your door within 48 hours.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["question_44LVpf","question_dHA7bE","question_kQJ3cY"],"name":"Collapsible tabs","settings":{"title":"Read more"}}},"order":["main","rich_text_f4aHTj","rich_text_nzRTiM","slideshow_6cg